# Cart Clash automated loop

The root `AGENTS.md`, `docs/BRIEFING.md`, and existing `cart-clash.mdc` remain
authoritative. `.agent/` is an optional loop and memory layer; it must not
override the Cart Clash rules.

The automated loop uses `deepseek-v4-flash` through the local
`deepseek-cursor-proxy` at `http://127.0.0.1:9000/v1`. Keep
`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` in the user environment only. Never place keys in this repo.

Run the bounded loop from the persistent agentic-stack checkout:

```bash
python -X utf8 -m harness_manager.cli loop validate --target . --loop cart-clash-qa
python -X utf8 -m harness_manager.cli loop run cart-clash-qa "<one bounded task>" --target . --approved
```

The runner uses worktree isolation, `npm run qa` verification, a separate
read-only checker, bounded attempts, and no deploy, push, commit, or staging.
Inspect the run checkpoint before accepting a change.

Cursor desktop can still use its custom DeepSeek model. Cursor CLI is not the
model runner because it rejects desktop-only custom model IDs.
